OL,3,GNEWSAYouth footballers abandon team
OL,4,Atalk for steam train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA youth football manager has said he
OL,7,F"loved it" when his under-9s
OL,8,Funexpectedly abandoned their post-match
OL,9,Fteam talk to chase after a steam train.
OL,11,FBlandford United Royals' head coach
OL,12,FAdam Day said his players had just
OL,13,Ffinished playing Swanage away on
OL,14,FSunday, close to the Swanage Railway,
OL,15,Fwhen the locomotive chugged past.
OL,17,F"As I turn to begin our post-match team
OL,18,Ftalk, I've totally lost them," he
OL,19,Fjoked, as video of the excited
OL,20,Ffootballers has racked up millions of
OL,21,Fviews on social media.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
