OL,3,GNEWSAYouth footballers abandon team
OL,4,Atalk for steam train
OL,5,
OL,6,FDay, who has coached the side for three
OL,7,Fyears, said: "It was genuinely great to
OL,8,Fsee them so happy and just being kids."
